Changes made to the original: only the columns name, platform, category,
description, retention period and wildcard match are kept; whitespace is
collapsed; the categories are mapped to the ones of the cookie notice
(Functional, Security and Necessary -> necessary; Personalization ->
preferences; Analytics -> statistics; Marketing -> marketing). The extract is
regenerated with tools/open-cookie-database.mjs, which also records the source
commit inside the JSON.
